Plant Collection
===================

Setiap plant punya nama. Ada 3 tipe plant:
1. Flower (punya color)
2. HousePlant (punya growthTime)
3. Tree (punya height)


Maintenance schedule 
----------------------
1. Watering : flower, houseplant
2. Pruning : houseplant, tree
3. Fretizing : all

Class :
- Main
- Plant <-- abstract, fertilizing()
  a. Flower
  b. Tree
  c. HousePlant